     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: PractitionerRole practitionerrole-single-example</b></p><a name=\"practitionerrole-single-example\"> </a><a name=\"hcpractitionerrole-single-example\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ph-core-practitionerrole.html\">PH Core PractitionerRole</a></p></div><p style=\"border: 1px #661aff solid; background-color: #e6e6ff; padding: 10px;\">Maria Clara Santos (official): Physician at Philippine General Hospital (Healthcare Provider) (https://nhfr.doh.gov.ph/#1234567890) (http://doh.gov.ph/fhir/Identifier/practitioner-role-id#PR-OPD-001)</p><hr/><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"Record is active\">Active:</td><td colspan=\"3\">true</td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"The practitioner who is able to provide the services in this role\">Practitioner:</td><td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"Practitioner-practitioner-single-example.html\">Maria Clara Santos (official)</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"The organization where the practitioner performs the roles\">Organization:</td><td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"Organization-organization-pgh-example.html\">Philippine General Hospital (Healthcare Provider) (https://nhfr.doh.gov.ph/#1234567890)</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"Roles which this practitioner is authorized to perform for the organization\">Role:</td><td colspan=\"3\"><span title=\"Codes:{https://fhir.doh.gov.ph/phcore/CodeSystem/prc 2200}\">Physician</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"The specialties of the practitioner in this role\">Specialty:</td><td colspan=\"3\"><span title=\"Codes:{http://snomed.info/sct 394802001}\">General medicine</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"The locations at which the practitioner provides care\">Location:</td><td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"Location-location-single-example.html\">Philippine General Hospital (Hospital)</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"Ways to contact the practitioner in this role\">Contact Detail</td><td colspan=\"3\"><ul><li><a href=\"tel:+63-2-8651-7800\">+63-2-8651-7800</a></li><li><a href=\"mailto:maria.santos@doh.gov.ph\">maria.santos@doh.gov.ph</a></li></ul></td></tr></table></div>"
